codex
For the symbolic stage, I’m first proving one exact fixed-semantics invocation to pin down the call-frame and heap framing. This is a diagnostic claim only; it will be replaced by a theorem quantified over four arbitrary nonempty digit sequences, so no bounded example can be mistaken for the target proof.
exec
