codex
The phase-3 invariant reached the right recursive state and exposed a smaller issue: I had abstracted the module scope too broadly, so name lookup had to consider a spurious shadowed `ord`. The real invocation’s module scope is empty, so I’m tightening the invariant to that exact binding context; this is a sound scope refinement, not a semantic extension.
apply patch
